# Phase 7.2 — line-ending normalization. The repo had mixed CRLF/LF
# (app.py was CRLF, voice_engine.py was LF, etc.), which made diffs
# noisy and broke some tools' expectations. Force LF for everything
# Git sees as text; let Git's auto-detection figure out what's text
# based on the file's content (`text=auto`).

* text=auto eol=lf

# Specific overrides (none yet; pin per file if a tool ever insists
# on a particular encoding).
